{"_id":"68a7363c8ec3d8323af1f134","nodeId":"ytwCkSMTiTuemE0KVfAfy","roadmapSlug":"sql","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:40.099Z","description":"# HAVING\n\nHAVING is a clause in SQL that filters the results of a `GROUP BY` query. It's like a `WHERE` clause, but it operates on groups rather than individual rows. You use `HAVING` to specify conditions that the group must meet to be included in the final result set.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"SQL HAVING Clause","url":"https://www.programiz.com/sql/having","_id":"69bba6b933a0ad7a57afe71f"},{"type":"video","title":"HAVING Clause","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tYBOMw7Ob8E","_id":"69bba6b933a0ad7a57afe720"}],"updatedAt":"2026-03-19T07:33:13.508Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d0416838","title":"DataCamp - SQL Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/ZVeXng"},{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d04167c7","title":"roadmap.sh - Master SQL","partner":"roadmap.sh","type":"course","url":"https://roadmap.sh/courses/sql"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/sql/content/ytwCkSMTiTuemE0KVfAfy.md"}